    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Screen Talk: Naomi Ackie"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We welcome Naomi Ackie, who is appearing in I Love Boosters in the festival, to this Screen Talk to discuss her career."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/wicker-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Wicker"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Olivia Colman gives yet another bravura performance in this delightfully offbeat comedy, playing an outcast from her village who orders herself a wicker husband."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/klara-and-the-sun-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Klara and the Sun"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Oscar winner Taika Waititi’s luminous adaptation of Kazuo Ishiguro’s bestselling novel sees Jenna Ortega play an enthusiastic artificial friend desperate to find a loving home."
    }
